{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-title='SSH'>\r\n\t\t\tSSH\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Generate RSA keys, drop a host from known_hosts, and load a .pem with ssh-add.","label":"Keys","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect","label":"Reconnect","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Generate keys<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh-keygen -t rsa<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSpecify the path when prompted. It does not take it by default.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Remove a host key<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh-keygen -R &lt;host&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRemoves the key from <code class='inline'>known_hosts<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Add a key file<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh-add &lt;file.pem&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdds the key file to the global store, for direct login without having to specify the key file.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Verbose<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh -v<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Input key file<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>-i &lt;input file&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/keys\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/keys\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect' data-title='Reconnect' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Reconnect<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-title='SSH'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SSH<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}